职好几份工作才能养活自己，其中也包括我在内。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara007_1_face_chara007_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"拉碧丝","text":"[show]不过作为可靠的前辈，我不得不先身士卒啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"拉碧丝-友善2","script":"yd_007_02"}